    "## 🌍 Step 4: Download Macro Variables\n",
    "\n",
    "### Academic Justification (Chen, Roll, Ross, 1986):\n",
    "\n",
    "**Macroeconomic factors drive stock returns:**\n",
    "1. **Interest Rates**: Affect discount rates for future cash flows\n",
    "2. **Volatility (VSTOXX)**: Market fear gauge (Whaley, 2000)\n",
    "3. **Oil Prices**: Impact energy and transport sectors (Jones & Kaul, 1996)\n",
    "4. **Exchange Rates**: Currency risk for exporters (Dumas & Solnik, 1995)\n",
    "5. **Gold**: Safe haven asset during uncertainty"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
